{"unit_id":"keman-ai__dsh-pocket#card-zh","repo":"keman-ai/dsh-pocket","commit":"55ee2460623694b221ced2a74cb0b9ddabd2c5fe","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Pocket 是面向 web 客户端的 DSH 手机远程控制插件：它通过本机 Web server 路由和外连 relay，把电脑上的会话列表与实时输出呈现在手机浏览器。用户可查看会话、发送文字或照片、停止运行中的 turn、审批工具调用、回答 agent 问题，并调整模型及界面偏好。适合希望离开电脑时继续观察和处理 DSH 会话的人。需要 A2H 账号并启用插件；relay 默认关闭。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:35-44","src/index.ts:180-187","src/actions.ts:20-89","src/settings.ts:28-37","cordis.patch.yml:8-12"]}
{"unit_id":"keman-ai__dsh-pocket#card-en","repo":"keman-ai/dsh-pocket","commit":"55ee2460623694b221ced2a74cb0b9ddabd2c5fe","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Pocket brings DSH sessions to a phone browser. It streams activity through an outbound relay. Users can view sessions, send text or photos, stop turns, approve tool calls, answer agent questions, and change selected preferences. Requires an A2H account; relay is disabled by default.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:35-44","src/index.ts:180-187","src/actions.ts:20-89","src/settings.ts:28-37","cordis.patch.yml:8-12"]}
